# Build context of orchestration/Containerfile (the repository root): only what the
# image needs. This keeps API keys (.illustris_api_key.txt, .hf_*), .env files,
# data, outputs, virtual environments and .git out of the image.
#
# It has to be here rather than next to the Containerfile: Buildah 1.33 doesn't
# find orchestration/Containerfile.containerignore when podman-compose passes
# relative paths.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!pipelines/
!orchestration/dags/
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
